<title>NETHERLANDS: HBG share split effective on July 14.</title>
<headline>HBG share split effective on July 14.</headline>
<dateline>RIJSWIJK, Netherlands 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Hollandsche Beton Groep NV said on Monday its 10 for one share split would become effective on July 14.</p>
<p>The largest Dutch construction group said in March it planned to split the shares.</p>
<p>HBG's shareholders approved the split-up proposal at the annual general meeting which was held on May 16.</p>
